WEBVTT

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:16.700
Stop it, Maron.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:22.500
I apologize for suddenly calling you over.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.370
What are you talking about?

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.290
I'm happy to come over
any time you like, Reiko.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.290
Japan Arts Enterprise
Chihiro Ayagi

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.840
That's what you say now.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.840
Venus Inc., Owner
Reiko

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.180
Wait, have you lost a little weight?

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:35.930
You can tell?

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.760
I lost 200 grams!

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:42.020
That much?! You are working way too hard.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:48.060
You know, I hate to bring this up,
but did you suggest me for that one part?

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:53.440
That's so like you to have no delicacy, Chihiro.

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.280
Toy Poodle, Male,
2 Years Old
Maron

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:57.450
Right?

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:01.700
I ran it by him,
so you should be getting a call soon.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:05.620
Thank you. I knew I could count on my Reiko.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.000
You really are a slick one.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.930
She is so easy, as always.

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:24.810
I smell like dog.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:29.860
hug 5 "I can make you my woman."

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.860
Hey! The second we get here,
you're ready to go?

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:31.980
Please let me ravish you.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:39.070
One kiss lasts eight seconds,
which is 450 in an hour and 10,800 in a day!

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:44.580
What's 450? 10,800?
What are you blathering on about?

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:46.540
Stop it!

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.040
Takato. Takato.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:52.170
Hey, Chunta, no marks.

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:00.850
I know.

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:03.470
I won't leave any, Takato.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:40.740
<i>Why the hell did he look so disappointed?</i>

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:42.320
Nitto Talent Agency
Takato Saijo

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:44.780
<i>All I did was say don't leave a mark on me.
It's like I'm the bad guy here.</i>

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:49.540
<i>Being looked at is my line of work,
so it's only natural that I'm careful.</i>

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.830
<i>In the first place,
I'm spending my time with him.</i>

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.630
<i>This in-heat rabbit should be grateful for that!</i>

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.670
Takato, are you okay?

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:03.050
Huh? You're cute when you look all sullen.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:05.050
Want some water?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.100
I feel sluggish.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:07.810
Mitsuya Production
Junta Azumaya

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.810
I thought so.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.470
Then I'll transfer the water from my mouth to—

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.230
Just give me the water, you horny angel!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:14.940
Sorry.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:21.150
I was thinking how I can't see you for a few days
starting next week so I got really worked up.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.820
You're shooting on location
for that TV drama, right?

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.820
Yes. And today was the first day
of your rehearsals, right?

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.200
Don't touch me! That's annoying.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.330
How did it go?

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:34.460
I hadn't been on stage for a while,
but once I was there, I got fired up.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.130
Today we just did a script reading,

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.840
but the script is entertaining,
and it moves at a nice tempo.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:45.890
The cast members are seasoned stage vets, too,
so I had a good feeling about it.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.140
However!

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.260
Do you know Chihiro Ayagi?

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:51.350
Who's that?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:54.020
His face shines bright,
but his heart is black as night.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:57.060
I guess he made his debut
around the same time as you,

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.190
and he's playing the lead in the show!

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:02.400
It's his first time being on stage,
and he doesn't show up!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.360
He's pretty gutsy.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:08.410
Lucky.
I want to costar with you on something.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.620
We just did!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.580
Well, you should do a play
sooner rather than later.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.750
I'm sure it'll help improve—

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.380
Hey, what the hell? I'm spent.

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:23.010
If that lead isn't enthusiastic about it,
I wish I could take over for him.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.050
It's frustrating.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.390
All I really want to do is be with you like this.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:31.220
<i>Like this? Like what?</i>

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.600
Dummy. You've got your drama.
Go do your best.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.650
I will, so why don't we move in together?

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:40.230
Why would you say that?
They're not related!

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.940
Then at least take this.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.690
A card key?

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.030
The key to my place.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.990
Please use it anytime you like.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:55.450
I would be overjoyed
if you'd come here without being invited.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.370
<i>A duplicate key.</i>

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:02.210
<i>Come to think of it, even though
he's brought me here countless times,</i>

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.670
<i>I've never come here on my own.</i>

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:07.840
I'll hold on to it.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.350
Great!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.690
Chihiro Ayagi's Manager
Hajime Mitamaru

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.820
Ayagi! Hurry, hurry!

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.980
Rehearsal's already started!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.190
Don't give me, "Eh?"

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:30.660
After you blew off the first day, it doesn't
look good if you're late the next day!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:32.280
Blew off?

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.910
That was because of
a sudden schedule change, right?

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.790
Besides, the first day
is just like a meet and greet, you know?

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.000
Don't worry about it.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:44.460
Not a care in the world.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:50.050
You got this role on the recommendation
of the sponsor, so you have to get results!

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:53.100
I know, jeez. So annoying.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:07:00.020
<i>It was no favor. This is the result of me
working my butt off in this business.</i>

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:05.730
<i>If only the people higher-up were all women,
this would just be so easy.</i>

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:08.570
Have you ever known me to blow a part?

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.280
This one'll be easy to do like the others.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:12.820
Don't treat it so lightly!

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:16.540
This time your costar is Takato Saijo.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.950
If you don't give it your all, he'll steal the show.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:21.960
<i>Takato, huh?</i>

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.500
<i>Is he really that great?</i>

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.250
Come on, let's hurry!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.670
Okay, okay.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:32.220
He skips the first day, and today he's late.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.680
Even though Takato Saijo let him have the lead.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.680
I'm really sorry, Takato.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:47.190
I don't mind, since the role you wrote for me
is juicier than the rest in my opinion, Mr. Kitano.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.490
Really? I'm happy to hear that!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.780
I love you, Takato!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.780
Theater Company
"Southern News Agency"
Theater Director
Kazuki Kitano

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:58.040
Besides, I realized on the job before this one
that it's not bad playing a supporting role.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:00.000
Oh, with the angel?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.210
It was his first starring role,
so I didn't know what to expect,

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.380
but he turned out to be a superb performer.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.590
I want to use him, too.

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:11.220
Please do.
I'm sure he would shine on the stage, too.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:14.010
Nice! He's got your seal of approval?

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.180
Morning.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:19.310
My gig right before this ran long.

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:23.440
I'm Ayagi, and from today,
I'll be rehearsing with you guys.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.400
It's good to be here.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:29.360
So the lead finally showed up!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:34.450
Sorry about that. I wanted to start rehearsing
as soon as possible, but...

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:36.160
<i>Huh, so this is Takato Saijo in the flesh.</i>

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:42.120
<i>He's a good-looking guy,
but he's younger than he seems on film.</i>

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.420
<i>He's shorter than me, too.</i>

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:47.080
It's an honor to perform with you, Mr. Saijo.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:51.880
Likewise.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.590
<i>Taller than average.</i>

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:54.380
Thanks.

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.590
<i>For a second there,
I totally felt like he sized me up.</i>

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:59.390
So are you ready to go?

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.060
Yes, no problem.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:04.520
Just give me a quick rundown of the setup,
and I'm good.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:09.980
Then let's take it from the top,
through Takato's bit.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:13.440
Machii, run him through the sword fight!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.820
Sure.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:20.700
When your opponent comes,
sweep right, sweep left, and step back.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.750
If the sword hits here, then hold it.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:24.830
Got it.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.830
Basically, you make big swings.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:31.300
Nice. The kid reeks
with this nice sense of arrogance.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.800
That's fine, but from the very beginning?

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:37.680
Oh, sure.
We should deal with everything early on.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.720
That big head of his is about to get snapped.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:43.430
Snapped, huh?

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:48.150
Okay, next, the mountains of the Hidden Door,
the scene where Shigesada, played by Ayagi,

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:51.690
first meets Tsunewaka, played by Saijo.
Let's do that.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.820
Please wait, Lord Shigesada!

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:57.860
We're about to enter the ogres' domain.
We shouldn't...

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:02.620
What? I didn't come to fight.
I just want to talk to them.

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:05.960
<i>Filming may be more up my alley after all.</i>

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.080
They're not the type you can talk to.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:12.460
<i>With that, there's no need for rehearsal,
and if you get it right, it's over with one take.</i>

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:15.210
Still, this is a beautiful place.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:18.590
<i>Well, guess I'll just breeze through it
until opening night.</i>

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.050
The sound of a flute?

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.680
<i>And here he comes.</i>

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:26.810
A robe made of red leaves.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.730
Don't tell me. The ogress, Kureha?!

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:34.690
<i>Let me see
that famous hard-earned acting ability, senpai.</i>

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:43.410
Oh? Wasn't that ogress' head hunted down
and chopped off ages ago? By humans?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.910
Are you a man?! Who are you?!

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.080
This is the Hidden Door.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:52.210
So of course I must be an ogre, yes?

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.680
Please stand back, Lord Shigesada!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:02.970
We shall handle this!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.560
<i>My line!</i>

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:10.190
Stand down, you two!
As I said, we didn't come here to fight.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:13.980
<i>Draw my sword and intervene.</i>

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.400
Hey! I just came here to talk!

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:25.160
<i>After he parries my subordinate's swing,
Tsunewaka's...</i>

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:29.160
<i>Damn it! The stage is on an incline,
so it's hard to move!</i>

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:32.250
Talk?

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.340
<i>Oh shoot, I'm slipping!</i>

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:41.220
Your movement should be different
when you're on an incline.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:45.180
If you don't get used to this sloping stage,
you'll likely be injured.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:47.010
Okay.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.140
Also...

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:52.850
it's unsatisfying to the audience
if the lead gets eaten, Ayagi.

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:56.110
Keep that in mind.
You're our all-important lead.

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.530
Takato gives me goosebumps.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:06.740
<i>I'm surprised. He's actually a nice guy.</i>

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:11.120
Thank you for the advice, senpai.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:23.470
Delicious! That's the stuff!

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:27.600
Nothing better than a beer
after taking an arrogant newbie down a peg!

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:31.890
Don't think costarring with me
is gonna be any walk in the park!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:35.350
I'll teach you how tough this business can be!

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:47.070
<i>It's been a while since I've been able to just
go home like this without being abducted.</i>

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:51.790
<i>It must have been like this
before he fastened himself onto me,</i>

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:54.000
<i>but it's quieter than I remember.</i>

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.130
<i>He didn't call?</i>

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.590
<i>It smells different.</i>

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:04.720
<i>I've been using his shampoo
more often than not lately.</i>

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:06.220
<i>I can't relax.</i>

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:10.930
<i>Living together, huh?</i>

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:14.690
What the hell?

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.360
Chunta

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.440
<i>Good work today, Takato!</i>

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.360
What?

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:27.200
<i>Nothing. I imagined you arriving home,
taking a bath,</i>

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:31.740
<i>getting out with your hair still wet, and having
a beer right about now, so I thought I'd call.</i>

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:34.830
I see. Is there a camera in here?
A bugging device? Where'd you hide it?

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.580
Never mind. So, what do you want?

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.840
<i>Nothing. I just wanted to hear your voice.</i>

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.420
<i>Idiot. I was with you yesterday.</i>

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:48.180
<i>Do you intend to call me every day
until you get back?</i>

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.220
I'd like to, but...

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:54.520
only hearing your voice is agonizing.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.890
I can't touch you. I can't smell you.

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:57.810
<i>Idiot.</i>

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.400
I've got it! Let's do telephone se—

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.230
<i>I'll hang up.</i>

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.360
- I'll pay 1,000—
- Bye.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.690
All right, then this is fine.

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:10.070
Can I hear your voice
just a little longer, Takato?

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.290
Takato?

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.580
<i>When you say something like that,
it makes it more difficult to speak!</i>

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.500
<i>I swear, this guy.</i>

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.340
F-Fine.

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:25.380
But I'm going to hang up
if I get sleepy, though.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.260
<i>Sure!</i>

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:32.850
All right, last one!
The main visual for the show's pamphlet.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:36.430
We're doing a two-shot
with Mr. Saijo and Mr. Ayagi.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.440
Is Mr. Ayagi ready?

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:42.440
Yes! I'm just touching him up now!

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:45.650
- Done! So handsome!
- Roger! Okay, what about Mr. Saijo?

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:46.990
Thanks.

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:50.530
<i>Come to think of it,
I haven't seen Takato in costume yet.</i>

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.240
I'm ready, too.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.040
I can go anytime.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:06.170
Well, you're staring. Is something wrong?

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.510
I was wondering
who this beautiful woman was.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:14.260
I look forward to this photoshoot.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.600
Me, too.

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:21.600
Hey! Crank up the wind
so their costumes billow out more!

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.730
Like this?

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.480
Yeah, that's good.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:30.240
Now, Shigesada and Tsunewaka, with
your weapons crossed like that, get real close!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.360
<i>His eyelashes are so long.</i>

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:35.330
<i>And cat eyes. If he were a woman, he'd be...</i>

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.450
Lead!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.580
I want you to focus.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:43.000
If you daydream so much,
I'll accidentally eat you alive.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:46.250
<i>More like that's what you intend.</i>

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.710
Go easy on me, senpai.

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:51.300
You don't have to hold back.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:54.180
Or is this all you've got?

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:55.550
<i>Screw you!</i>

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.230
<i>Don't try to provoke me.
What a pain in the ass.</i>

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:03.440
<i>It's not my hobby to make sensual banter!</i>

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.940
<i>This is what you want, huh?!</i>

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:11.450
Well, well.
You were holding out on me after all.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:14.910
You can make a nice face, huh, junior?

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.740
<i>Damn it! I fell for it!</i>

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:19.750
I like it!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.750
Ayagi! You were really into it today, huh?

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:27.920
It may be the first time I've seen you like that!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.760
It was the usual.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:31.550
Huh? Low energy?

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:34.760
Have you ever seen me with high energy?

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:33.800
They were both so cool!

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:39.350
Yeah. I thought Azumaya
was eclipsing Mr. Saijo lately,

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:40.520
<i>Pisses me off. I like playing,
but I hate getting played.</i>

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:43.270
but today he reminded me why he was
the Sexiest Man for five years straight!

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.730
<i>That ruined my day.</i>

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.230
He has true mastery.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:51.440
Sexiest Man of the Year, huh?

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:55.160
Nothing. As long as I have fun, right?

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.910
Takato, can I get a shot of you in that outfit?

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.580
My daughter says she wants to see it.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.000
<i>After all, you took me for a ride.</i>

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.000
Nana does?

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:08.380
What would the expression
on your face be if you were ridden, Takato?

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.460
Ayagi?

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.170
Takato Saijo

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.130
<i>He's been on location for four days now.</i>

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:17.300
<i>Maybe I'll send him a text for once.</i>

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:19.140
<i>No, that would only encourage him.</i>

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:21.680
<i>Well, I guess encouraging him a little
wouldn't hurt.</i>

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:22.770
Excuse me.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.980
You're not done changing yet? My bad.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.690
Ayagi.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.610
I don't mind,
but maybe you should've knocked first.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:31.360
So, what is it?

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:35.030
<i>I already taught this bastard a lesson or two,
and he's still a bastard?</i>

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.740
Actually, I wanted to ask your advice, Mr. Saijo.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:40.160
As an actor.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.830
Are you free after this?

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.580
I want to make this play a success, so...

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:50.380
I'm changing. Can you wait a little bit?

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:52.670
Thank you.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.300
<i>He's pretty defenseless.</i>

00:17:56.720 --> 00:18:00.100
<i>Looking at him like this,
he's pretty slim and elegant for his height.</i>

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:04.020
<i>That reminds me. When I grabbed him during
the shoot, his shoulders were pretty thin.</i>

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:06.730
<i>Looks like it would be easy
to wrap my arms around his waist.</i>

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:07.230
Mr. Saijo, you have a beautiful back.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.150
Fweh!

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:09.940
Fweh?

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.320
No, I mean...

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:14.150
Mr. Saijo.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.990
<i>What's this?
Did that come through loud and clear?</i>

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.530
<i>Not bad.</i>

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:23.790
That was a cute reaction. "Fweh!"
Did you feel that?

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.250
Y-You just surprised me.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.710
"Fweh"?

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:29.120
Anybody would be surprised
if they suddenly got touched.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.130
And I didn't say, "Fweh.”

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.250
Huh? You didn't say that?

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.090
Then...

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.130
Wha... Hey!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.010
Now how does this feel?

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.090
Cut it out!

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:43.310
Mr. Saijo! Mr. Kitano wants
to go out drinking with everyone. Are you in?

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.810
Would you let me finish getting dressed?

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.560
Advice! If you don't mind explaining
while drinking, then I'll listen.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:50.900
Right, while drinking!

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:55.650
<i>Well, I guess his guard
will be lower than if we were alone. But...</i>

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:57.440
Squish.

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.700
<i>I finally got him drunk, but what is this?</i>

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:05.120
<i>Takato Saijo keeps peeling edamame.</i>

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:08.210
Squish, squish, squish.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:08.210
Mr. Saijo, what are you going to do
with all that edamame?

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:09.710
Not givin' you any.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.170
I don't want any.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:14.590
Isn't that hilarious? Takato's weird behavior.

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:17.670
He's always like this when he gets drunk.
It's performance art!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:20.380
But you were good at getting him to drink.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:23.850
I'm used to it.
I was a bartender a long time ago.

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:25.930
<i>I'm sick of hearing
your, "squish, squish," Takato.</i>

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.140
Hey, Ayagi.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.100
Yes?

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:31.770
When you were in middle school,
you were the type who, before a test...

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:37.280
somebody asked you, "Did you study?"
And you went, "Not at all." Right?

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:41.700
Takato also picks fights when he's drunk.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.200
<i>Seriously? What a pain.</i>

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:46.290
And it wasn't altogether a lie.

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:49.910
You were the clever, jerky type
who could master stuff without much effort.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.580
Be careful. It's not bad
to know how to swim with the tide.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:56.840
But if you rely on that too much, you'll be nothing
but a jack of all trades and master of none.

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:00.380
In this business,
unless you have crazy-powerful grace,

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.930
it's easy to get buried.

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:04.850
Which'd be a shame, 'cause you got flair.

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:08.890
Make full use of your skill,
and think about how you're gonna show it.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.020
I'll support you.

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:14.860
This is your first play,
a chance for you to mature.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:17.610
Do everything you can do, lead.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:21.110
Promise me that,
and I'll give you this edamame.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.610
He doesn't want it!

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.570
Take it! Take it!

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.120
<i>Shut up.</i>

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:31.040
Takato is blotto.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.290
I'm the one who encouraged him to drink,
so I'll take responsibility and get him home.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.420
We're counting on you! Good night!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.630
<i>How much of his lecturing do I have to take?</i>

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.930
<i>He's seriously annoying.</i>

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:48.140
"Be careful," huh?

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:52.100
You're the one who'd better be careful,
Takato-senpai.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:58.900
It's unusual for you
to be munching mints, Junta.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.320
I do it when I want
to put something in my mouth.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.780
I try to trick myself, but it's a poor substitute.

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:06.450
Want one, Narumiya?

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.740
<i>He's an archangel! Substitute?</i>

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.580
Thank you!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.410
Now that's refreshing!

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:18.250
Wow, check that out.
The typhoon slammed right into us, huh?

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:21.670
I hope it passes through by tomorrow,
our last day on location.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.430
Yeah, me, too.

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:32.520
I never thought of doing this with
another dude, but man, I'm at full mast.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:34.270
Not only doing, but...

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:45.150
I haven't gotten this excited in a long time.

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:49.490
Mr. Saijo...

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:54.460
I can make you my woman.

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:26.920
What are you doing here?

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:27.840
Your location shooting...

00:23:28.380 --> 00:23:29.220
Wait!

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:30.430
What the hell?! Wait!

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:32.340
F-Fine! Tonight's fine!

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:34.430
Hey, Chunta!

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:35.970
Hey, wh-what is this?!

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.980
hug6
"Why am I at a hotel with him...
Did we... There's no way... Is there!?"
